        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_units = 200_000\n    new_units = 220_000\n    price_per_unit = 250\n    variable_cost_per_unit = 65\n    fixed_operating_costs = 10_000_000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    initial_operating_income = (\n        initial_units * (price_per_unit - variable_cost_per_unit)\n        - fixed_operating_costs\n    )\n    new_operating_income = (\n        new_units * (price_per_unit - variable_cost_per_unit)\n        - fixed_operating_costs\n    )\n\n    operating_income_change_percentage = (\n        (new_operating_income - initial_operating_income)\n        / initial_operating_income\n        * 100\n    )\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(operating_income_change_percentage, 2)\n```",
